## Architecture (implement in this order)

| Step | Phase | File(s) | Purpose |
|------|-------|---------|---------|
| 1 | 1 | `src/theme.ts` | Colors, spacing, radii, typography scale |
| 2 | 1 | `src/components/ui/IconButton.tsx` | Back, restart, settings |
| 3 | 1 | `src/components/ui/GameHudNav.tsx` | Nav row: back + restart with confirm |
| 4 | 1 | `src/components/ui/ConfirmDialog.tsx` | Restart confirmation (or `Alert` wrapper) |
| 5 | 1 | `src/i18n.ts` | `confirmRestart`, `confirmRestartMessage`, `cancel` |
| 6 | 2–3 | `src/components/ui/SegmentedControl.tsx` | Spin / english selectors |
| 7 | 3 | `src/components/ui/PowerMeter.tsx` | Charge UI |
| 8 | 2 | `src/components/GameHud.tsx` | Shared shell; game-specific score slots |

**Refactor targets:** `BilliardsView.tsx`, `FourBallView.tsx` (replace inline HUD), `SettingsScreen.tsx` (shared back), `SettingsContext.tsx` (gap constant).

**Do not add** a heavy UI library — use RN core + `@expo/vector-icons` (already in Expo).

