## Phased Implementation

### Phase 1 — Foundation (nav + theme)

**Status:** Done  
**Scope:** Shared design tokens, reusable nav buttons, restart confirm dialog. Scoreboard / tech row / win banner stay unchanged until Phase 2+.

#### In scope

| Task | Deliverable |
|------|-------------|
| Design tokens | `src/theme.ts` |
| Generic pressable | `src/components/ui/IconButton.tsx` |
| Game nav row | `src/components/ui/GameHudNav.tsx` |
| Confirm dialog | `src/components/ui/ConfirmDialog.tsx` (or RN `Alert.alert` wrapper) |
| i18n | `confirmRestart`, `confirmRestartMessage`, `cancel` in `src/i18n.ts` |
| Integration | Replace inline back/restart in `BilliardsView`, `FourBallView`, `SettingsScreen` back |

#### Out of scope (defer)

- Full `GameHud` shell extraction
- Scoreboard redesign, segmented controls, power meter card, win overlay
- Intro screen button restyle

#### 1. `src/theme.ts`

Centralize tokens used by Phase 1 nav (expand in later phases):

```ts
export const colors = {
  hudBg: '#1b4332',
  felt: '#2d6a4f',
  textOnDark: '#ffffff',
  textMuted: '#a8c5b8',
  navGhost: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.12)',
  navGhostPressed: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.22)',
  danger: '#e44',
  accent: '#2cc47a',
};
export const spacing = { xs: 4, sm: 8, md: 12, lg: 16 };
export const radii = { sm: 6, md: 12 };
export const touch = { minSize: 44 };
export const typography = { label: 13, labelSm: 11 };
```

#### 2. `IconButton`

Props: `icon` (React node or Ionicons name), `label?`, `onPress`, `variant: 'ghost' | 'danger'`, `accessibilityLabel`.

- Hit area ≥ `touch.minSize` (44×44) via `hitSlop` or min width/height
- Ghost variant: transparent bg, white icon @ 70% opacity; pressed → 100%
- Optional `label` beside icon; hide label when `label` omitted (settings/game compact)

#### 3. `GameHudNav`

Props: `lang`, `onBack`, `onRestart`, `skipRestartConfirm?: boolean` (for future win-state Play Again).

Layout:

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  [← Back]                    [↻ Restart]     │  dark green bar (#1b4332)
└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- Row only — **no turn/shot text** in this row (turn text stays in existing score row until Phase 2)
- Back: `Ionicons` `chevron-back` + `t(lang, 'back')`
- Restart: `Ionicons` `refresh` + `t(lang, 'restart')`; on press → confirm dialog
- Confirm: title `t(lang, 'confirmRestart')`, message `t(lang, 'confirmRestartMessage')`, Cancel / Restart (destructive)
- Container: `width: '95%'`, `borderRadius: radii.md`, `paddingHorizontal: spacing.sm`, `paddingVertical: spacing.xs`, `backgroundColor: colors.hudBg`

#### 4. Integration (minimal diff)

**`BilliardsView.tsx` / `FourBallView.tsx`**

Replace:

```tsx
<View style={styles.hudRow}>
  <TouchableOpacity style={styles.backBtn} ...>
  <TouchableOpacity style={styles.restartBtn} ...>
  {turn/shot Text}
</View>
```

With:

```tsx
<GameHudNav lang={lang} onBack={onBack} onRestart={restart} />
{/* turn/shot Text — keep in place below nav until Phase 2 */}
```

Remove dead styles: `backBtn`, `backText`, `restartBtn`, `restartText` from each file.

**`SettingsScreen.tsx`**

Replace header `TouchableOpacity` back with `<IconButton icon="chevron-back" label={t(lang,'back')} onPress={onBack} variant="ghost" />` — adapt colors to existing green header or align header to `theme.colors.hudBg`.

